    "body": "This could maybe work similar to https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#cereactions, though the IDL steps (method steps, etc.) don't have access to the types involved. So you'd need something like `[Permission=(Promise<undefined>, \"webshare\")]` I think.\r\n\r\n(FWIW, I looked at Storage and Notifications API and neither could use this I think.)",
