    "body": "So to be clear I think the next step would be to (somehow) find all the callers of \"allowed to use\", and divide them up into categories like:\r\n\r\n- Could use this with no modifications\r\n- Could use this but it would change exception ordering\r\n- Could not use this\r\n- Classify each as promise vs. exception vs. boolean",
